  "scenes": {
    "scene_ro6_bat5_enter": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_enter",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "最初对话 · 湖中仙女",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_bat5_1",
        "choice_ro6_bat5_2"
      ],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 1,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "4"
          },
          "text": "你在林中听到一阵温柔的吟唱声，声音的来源坐于浅湖中心的礁石上，手捧一束鲜艳的花，身下的湖水波光粼粼。她正招手邀请你过去。\n",
          "text_sha256": "33eb4824828799d65bd832d947d3d79521a3cb3fd9c863ada31fb83125857eb3"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_1": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_1",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "她询问你的虔诚",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_bat5_3",
        "choice_ro6_bat5_4",
        "choice_ro6_bat5_6"
      ],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 3,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "“不少人都想找到湖中的秘宝，但总是缺乏诚意。”仙女用手将湖水拨弄出涟漪，露出腕上闪亮的手镯，“你愿意展现你的虔诚吗？”\n",
          "text_sha256": "9875ba57690f09f060a4aaf30a526ef3644ccbb80ef1b9cf3ffe2458fbcda3b6"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_2": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_2",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "没有理会她",
      "choice_ids": [],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 5,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "这片树海中难以解释的事太多，连眼见都不一定为实。你没有再看她一眼，快步离开了。\n",
          "text_sha256": "82ff5b750da2a251c6b7bf449fc5c2dcbbb943bc186066a2fde61415426b27f1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_5": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_5",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "已经捞出磁石",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_bat5_7",
        "choice_ro6_bat5_4",
        "choice_ro6_bat5_6"
      ],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 7,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "她从湖中捞出一块磁石，看起来并不怎么值钱。“或许我们可以把它丢回湖里，找出更好的东西，你愿意展现你的虔诚吗？”\n",
          "text_sha256": "ea74ce487fb6d0bfd768d34be1e364c2776fe93683c80f6293ed7e4195e11ba6"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_6": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_6",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "已经捞出破损手表",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_bat5_8",
        "choice_ro6_bat5_4",
        "choice_ro6_bat5_6"
      ],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 8,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "◈若在第一轮环节选择该选项，将会重复一次【选项一分支】，场景文字：<磁石被丢进湖里，仙女的手伸进湖水，这次她捞出一块手表，只是表盘已经破损，看起来也不怎么值钱。“或许我们可以把它丢回湖里，找出更好的东西，你愿意展现你的虔诚吗？”>◈若在第二轮环节再次选择该选项，将会进入【分支1后续】\n",
          "text_sha256": "6dfb5fd441e0b0af5e500b3259651cc7857c402ede81691a0e2dc948867ccceb"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_3": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_3",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "识破倒影",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_bat5_5"
      ],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 10,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "你看清了美丽仙女的倒影，那是一个似蛇似蝎的怪物，湖水映出了她的真面目，而她无法再欺骗你了。\n",
          "text_sha256": "7401a30b862c8ad1b572c7a4d4173dead76437c183b8942b39dc6722a3c9fec8"
        },
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 22,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "你看清了美丽仙女的倒影，那是一个似蛇似蝎的怪物，湖水映出了她的真面目，而她无法再欺骗你了。\n",
          "text_sha256": "7401a30b862c8ad1b572c7a4d4173dead76437c183b8942b39dc6722a3c9fec8"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_4": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_4",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "离开湖边",
      "choice_ids": [],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 13,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "她的话语焉不详，而你不想继续纠缠下去。\n",
          "text_sha256": "a85802a7dfb9787d4fbe8136697c9edb4fc23d0c7527604b711cdafa29a76dd7"
        },
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 25,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "她的话语焉不详，而你不想继续纠缠下去。\n",
          "text_sha256": "a85802a7dfb9787d4fbe8136697c9edb4fc23d0c7527604b711cdafa29a76dd7"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_7": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_7",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "随机结果：陷入险境",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_bat5_9"
      ],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 15,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "手表被丢进湖里，仙女的手伸进湖水，这次她捞出了一条腐烂的胳膊，破损的手表正牢牢箍在肿大的手腕上。你低头看向仙女在湖中的倒影——一只似蛇又像蝎的生物。周围的景色变幻了，蓝色的火焰将你们围了起来，仙女扭曲的声音萦绕在耳畔：“ ¿吗诚虔的你现展意愿你”\n",
          "text_sha256": "75d8d1a4c1ce294f063e9dc5caa915018b72542dd6e49a14af96fc34b07dde5f"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_8": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_8",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "随机结果：捞出礼物",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_bat5_10"
      ],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 18,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "你的虔诚让仙女十分感动，她将身下的湖水搅起一阵波涛，从水中捞出一件礼物送给你。\n",
          "text_sha256": "b10a28f1e70ae4f428917c49b92a98461a578433178911f915e1d16d2b4b12c9"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_ro6_bat5_9": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_bat5_9",
      "event_id": "lake",
      "label": "拿走宝物后的对话",
      "choice_ids": [],
      "source_cells": [
        {
          "file": "research/p3-current-lake-328/documented-table.html",
          "row": 20,
          "cell": 0,
          "attributes": {
            "colspan": "2"
          },
          "text": "你拿着仙女从湖里打捞出的宝物，深感虔诚在此地的重要性。\n",
          "text_sha256": "3c1aaf497435c7cd9aee989f08e4023dace49002a4babdc69a831bf68fef2e06"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
